{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1181902-guess-what-new-werewolf-ta-computer-game-announced","id":1181902,"title":"Guess What......New Werewolf TA Computer Game Announced.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-02T20:54:22-08:00","id":1181902,"title":"Guess What......New Werewolf TA Computer Game Announced.","content":"Found this tid-bit of information in my Twitter feed from White-Wolf themselves . <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/werewolftheapocalypse?src=hash\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/hashtag/werewolf...lypse?src=hash</a> All I know is that Cyanide and Focus Home will be working on this. Well, I all I can say is that I was there following the development of the original Heart of Gaia &amp; then it was dropped in to Malfeas (Development Hell WW style.) to never picked up again. \u200bLets all cross our fingers &amp; hope this one works out. I know the techology is truly with them this time around. None of the experimental wraparound and morphing graphics that I was never really pleased with in the first place. I wonder if any of the origin team from Dreamforge Entertainment. I knew one of them was also a White-Wolf writer as well. So, I had faith in that project. \u200bSome guy has also redesigned the Logo for Werewolf TA.....<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/DU9XLCkU8AA4qiC.jpg:large\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"useri