ere serious about that whole transmedia thing by announcing a videogame so far ahead of when it should be getting serious press for basically being at the stage of &quot;yeah we're going to do this.&quot;<br /> <br /> Regardless about how I feel about the end product for Earthblood... I would be very upset if it's basically a sacrificial lamb to marketing to keep people excited about WoD videogames while Bloodlines 2 was being developed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T12:02:12-07:00","id":1298692,"title":"","content":"Especially as a Werewolf game has been a known failure. So using one as a distraction from the more succesfulgame to get videogames out of is in rather poor taste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T12:21:06-07:00","id":1298698,"title":"","content":"I always thought it was rather strange they'd do a Werewolf game before their flagship, Vampire.<br /> Well, at the very least, I believe we can remove the notion of a 2020 release from our minds.<br /> <br /> Hopefully, this Season of the 